    {
      "id": 1659,
      "category": "researcher",
      "content": "The vulnerability is that HackerOne Emails are sent in clear-text instead of TLS which is so vulnerable since any Man-in-the-middle attacker is able to read these sensitive Emails and **get**:\n * Password-reset links Emails **---> Account Take over**\n * Private bug bounty programs names and activies **-->Information Disclosure**\n * Other private informations such as comments, support etc.. **-->Information Disclosure**",
      "updated_at": "2016-04-11T19:07:58.949Z",
      "can_view?": true,
      "can_create?": false,
      "attachments": [],
